            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/special+values+of+L-functions"} special values
            of the Riemann zeta function found (for the non-trivial region of non-positive integers) by
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Leonhard+Euler"} Leonhard Euler
            in 1734 and 1749 are
