          %h3#functional_equation Functional equation
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adelic+integral"} adelic integral
            representation of prop.
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#AdelicIntegralIncarnationOfCompletedZeta"}
            directly implies the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/functional+equation"} functional equation
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mover
                    %mi ζ
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ^
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 1
                  %mo −
                  %mi s
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mo =
                  %mover
                    %mi ζ
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ^
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi s
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                  \\hat \zeta(1-s) = \hat \zeta(s)
          %p
            of the completed zeta function from the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/functional+equation"} functional equation
            of the theta function
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
